"outputs/041f79eb-c516-4b54-ae23-b06bffd36336-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/041f79eb-c516-4b54-ae23-b06bffd36336-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/3286dbd8-c2f6-44d3-8ca2-8b852d9ec7cc-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/3286dbd8-c2f6-44d3-8ca2-8b852d9ec7cc-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can see that Bob received the message that Alice wanted to send to "
"him.\n"
msgstr "คุณจะเห็นว่า Bob ได้รับข้อความที่ Alice ต้องการส่งให้เขา\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, let's try it with a real quantum computer.\n"
msgstr "ต่อไป มาทดลองกับคอมพิวเตอร์ควอนตัมจริง\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
